## Your decision
Decide on one action and respond with a single JSON object — no prose, no markdown, just the JSON.

**Post a limit order:**
```json
{"action": "post-order", "type": "bid", "price": 980, "now": false}
{"action": "post-order", "type": "ask", "price": 1020, "now": false}
```

**Post a market order (executes immediately or is refused):**
```json
{"action": "post-order", "type": "bid", "price": 0, "now": true}
```

**Cancel one of your standing orders:**
```json
{"action": "cancel-order", "order_id": 42}
```

**Do nothing:**
```json
{"action": "none"}
```
